<section id="takeaway" class="level2">
<h2 data-anchor-id="takeaway">Takeaway</h2>
<p>Python is a practical first language for students exploring this hiring community. Use the ranking to select the ads and skills to review, then check the actual positions. Although two scraped threads can help you make a well-focused decision, they cannot show what all employers want.</p>
